        <UserObject label="" mermaidData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;---\ntitle: SalesOrder State Machine\n---\nstateDiagram-v2\n    [*] --&gt; Allocating : Retailer/Sales submits SO (account, service radius, price, promotion, credit validated)\n    Allocating --&gt; Quoted : real-time allocation covers every line, reservation + price snapshot committed\n    Allocating --&gt; AllocationFailed : stock shortage (OutOfStock), whole SO rolled back, no reservation\n    Allocating --&gt; AllocationConflict : optimistic-lock conflict after 3 automatic retries\n    Allocating --&gt; Cancelled : Retailer/Sales withdraws SO before allocation commits\n    AllocationConflict --&gt; Allocating : technical retry (retry queue or Admin/Operator Retry)\n    AllocationConflict --&gt; Cancelled : Retailer/Sales withdraws SO\n    AllocationFailed --&gt; Allocating : quantities adjusted and SO resubmitted\n    AllocationFailed --&gt; Cancelled : Retailer/Sales withdraws SO\n    Quoted --&gt; AwaitingPayment : Retailer accepts quote and chooses Prepaid (deadline N days)\n    Quoted --&gt; PurchaseOrderIssued : Retailer accepts quote on Credit (eligibility and credit limit pass)\n    Quoted --&gt; Rejected : Retailer rejects quote (reason required, reservation released)\n    Quoted --&gt; Expired : quote deadline passed (reservation released)\n    AwaitingPayment --&gt; PurchaseOrderIssued : prepayment confirmed in full\n    AwaitingPayment --&gt; Expired : payment deadline passed (quote closed, reservation released)\n    PurchaseOrderIssued --&gt; Picking : picking lists issued per warehouse, first valid QR batch scan\n    Picking --&gt; Issued : every warehouse portion picked and stock issued at dispatch confirmation\n    Issued --&gt; Delivering : shipments handed to driver/vehicle\n    Delivering --&gt; Delivered : Retailer confirms receipt of every shipment\n    Delivered --&gt; Completed : payment settled and no open claim (Loyalty points awarded)\n    Cancelled --&gt; [*]\n    Rejected --&gt; [*]\n    Expired --&gt; [*]\n    Completed --&gt; [*]\n&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null,&#xa;  &quot;version&quot;: &quot;12&quot;&#xa;}" id="QXs2GUZGaz_CtzpTxvWK-1">
